## 変更例（抜粋）

### 1) ConnectionMatrix の一次元化

```rust
// dictionary/types.rs
pub struct ConnectionMatrix {
    rows: u16,
    cols: u16,
    data: Box<[i16]>,
}

impl ConnectionMatrix {
    #[inline]
    pub fn get(&self, left_id: u16, right_id: u16) -> Option<i16> {
        let l = left_id as usize;
        let r = right_id as usize;
        if l < self.rows as usize && r < self.cols as usize {
            // SAFETY: 上の境界チェック済み
            let idx = l * self.cols as usize + r;
            Some(unsafe { *self.data.get_unchecked(idx) })
        } else {
            None
        }
    }
}
```

```rust
// dictionary/dict_resource.rs
impl DictionaryResource {
    #[inline]
    pub fn get_connection_cost(&self, l: u16, r: u16) -> Result<i16, RunomeError> {
        self.connections
            .get(l, r)
            .ok_or(RunomeError::InvalidConnectionId { left_id: l, right_id: r })
    }
}
```

（現状は `Vec<Vec<i16>>` で二重 `get()`）

### 2) `SystemDictionary::instance` のロック撤去

